            We did not run lab tests or taste panels for this guide. The picks come from label analysis, published third-party certifications and the research on protein quality, the same approach set out on our <a href="/how-we-test/">how we test page</a>. Where we mention taste or texture, we are passing on what buyers widely report rather than claiming a result of our own.
